{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2cbb616934eed5b5016bfc5265188efb869ba5d62fa039ec9ccb0be97a2d4340", "ja": "（亜美の新曲の、デモ音源が完成した！\nすごく楽しみにしてたし、早く聞かせたいな）", "zh": "（亚美新歌的试听音源做好了！我一直很期待，真想早点让她听听啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "98ce72fe9a35985ea0fccde2421ae1e5537bb4f3a3b2c79b35d2bc2b668e28b6", "ja": "へえ、亜美が恋の歌ね～。\nなかなか面白いじゃない。意外性もあるし。", "zh": "哦，亚美要唱恋爱歌曲呀～。\n还真有意思呢，也挺出人意料的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "593830f7e5eb77352e1d9480532135af3a1502bb76892b216e8a983a7be2acfb", "ja": "けど真美もこの前、恋の歌を歌ってたわよね。\n大丈夫？　また勝負なんてことには……。", "zh": "不过真美前阵子也唱过恋爱歌曲吧。\n没事吗？不会又要一决胜负了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "004fba0ba4bb96d9e13108df0163d3a3790494ce6f46c89c90bd4a154a305339", "ja": "それがいいんだよ、静香お姉ちゃん。\n真美がメラメラして、そんで亜美もメラメラして～！", "zh": "这样才好嘛，静香姐姐。真美燃起来，亜美也跟着燃起来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "5fd77cddf3b42ac2029098b33bc42f5728df4f39994a7b726c0f66161fef193a", "ja": "おーっと亜美選手、一歩リード！\n真美選手、巻き返せるのか！？　デッドヒーーーート！", "zh": "哦——亜美选手领先一步！\n真美选手能反超吗！？势均力敌的激——烈竞争！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "3473d6abb0c9bd5659a327a0c4377e4002adfea116db01291e73d04da51deb3d", "ja": "……とかやってるうちに、いつのまにか\n亜美と真美、トップアイドルになっちゃうワケ！", "zh": "……就这么比着比着，不知不觉间\n亚美和真美就会成为顶尖偶像啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "82d608ce2f2981693a965f76c7a7e57deae2c2249d76151a578729bba428c0fe", "ja": "一番近くに、一番のライバルがいるんだもんネ。\nすっごく楽しそうだヨ～。", "zh": "身边就有最强的对手嘛。感觉一定特别开心～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3ba3d72741db32009c8db28271101bee3f60c340dfc9f9ef2d500ac5b55a2526", "ja": "うん……なんだかそういうの、\nちょっとうらやましいかも。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得那样的关系，\n有点让人羡慕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "6a145ba16ded079c85d2675f48b22932462e2f296d8a691954022d655379eb4a", "ja": "けど亜美たち、ヌルい関係じゃないかんね？\n食うか食われるかの勝負だから！　オヤツとか！", "zh": "不过，亚美我们可不是那种不温不火的关系哦？  \n这是你吃我、我吃你的较量！比如零食之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1009_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a0b1340f100c21b63606914ef33f325475a070af7cb20627bdfcfca8a98b596c", "ja": "おーい、亜美……あ、いたいた。\n新曲のデモが完成したから、持って来たぞ。", "zh": "喂，亚美……啊，在这儿呢。\n新歌的试听样音做好了，我给你带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "e1cdfaa369af67454943262239898bf25cbd5f0c1a6b151b624b807fe65045ac", "ja": "やったー！　兄ちゃんさっすがー！\nカッコイイ！　よっ、雰囲気イケメン♪", "zh": "太棒啦——！大哥真靠得住——！\n帅呆了！哟，氛围感帅哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ba0fbc6494da6381578310663b6b340a5d258da3dbd1f8b81aa29d00b71eab3", "ja": "ありがとう。\n微妙に褒められてない気がするけど……？", "zh": "谢谢。\n不过总觉得好像算不上在夸我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4f1c031f36ba1b6acb6e25de688dca3434d3c544f22354ada911631f14a7971d", "ja": "お疲れさまです。今ちょうど、\n亜美ちゃんの新曲の話をしてたんですよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。我们刚好正在聊亚美的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "6163daf344cd67903617cc8478e1b1fb4e5ecc59c02f08541eace744a46479bd", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}、\nワタシも聞きたいナ～！　どんな曲か気になるヨ～！", "zh": "喂喂{$P$}，我也想听听呀～！到底是什么样的歌，好让人在意哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "346590a581281c174179092c4d07eaf911fbf34c20d9044f17c47db8d437e972", "ja": "ほらほら兄ちゃん、早くしたまえ！\n亜美をこんなに焦らすなんて……情熱的だね？", "zh": "快点快点，大哥，赶紧的！  \n居然让亚美这么心急……还真是热情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8006869192adb1ece9f72d4dd130a7788c4f3b614391ddacd1f7f195a4fdf944", "ja": "それなら、みんなで聴こうか。\nええと……これだ。", "zh": "那就一起听吧。\n呃……就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "68814e5651e962aedccf962fae53d39bc9dd744334b3970856746489176c5764", "ja": "わぁ、優しいメロディー……♪　これにあの歌詞が\n乗ったら、すごくドキドキしちゃいそう。", "zh": "哇，好温柔的旋律……♪　要是再配上那些歌词，感觉一定会让人心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "cd8ae700da499f37fdd51ed14e651e092e17d6f516805203453d16f79ae5c36d", "ja": "確かに、とってもいい歌だと思うけど。\nこれを亜美に歌わせるって……。", "zh": "确实，我觉得这是一首非常好的歌。\n但是让亚美来唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "62dd793f41dd266a9723a33654f4cf5d8ce21c053175a4c32d6e04dcd5d8f84e", "ja": "あんた、なにかヘンなこと\n考えてるわけじゃないでしょうね？", "zh": "你该不会在想什么奇怪的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "24d73ad05e31166ab614627b99f6c2d6df731d7619f52b6484d26ace173501df", "ja": "えぇっ、そういうこと？\n兄ちゃんの中のヘンタイが、タイヘンなことに……？", "zh": "诶诶，是这么回事？哥哥心里的变态，要闹出大事了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1022_p", "source_sha256": "aaccf7a9b536019e759ce1b75cc7f8004d7109f66ecd7fb950ba3737d0727188", "ja": "いや別に……亜美の新しい魅力を\n引き出せるんじゃないかと思っただけだよ。", "zh": "没那回事……我只是觉得，\n说不定能发掘出亚美崭新的魅力而已啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "9a3d18966a90fde8b11acddaeb0d43885e343a2b1491baa95d761dd97b1ecdb4", "ja": "んっふっふ～、兄ちゃんはほんと、亜美に\nゾッコンだね！　鼻の穴とか伸びまくりだよ☆", "zh": "嗯哼哼～，小哥真是被亚美迷得神魂颠倒呢！鼻孔都彻底变长啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7ee31cac7cffbaa6df982ebb92670c49b5bf757d80f6ea6096d6c0a1a82b45df", "ja": "鼻の下な。いや、伸びてないけど。", "zh": "是鼻子下面啦。呃，也没变长就是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "39a26500ba87329554646633c4e1482ca530f29810d8cd673ac4661a79f5e16c", "ja": "けど亜美、本当に大丈夫？\nその、歌詞とか……。", "zh": "不过亚美，真的没问题吗？\n那个，歌词什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "da37f36a7fd21094230e0d550abc253783ad25aeda111cad142b60a31aeec4e3", "ja": "えっ？　ダイジョーブって、\n静香お姉ちゃん、どういう意味？", "zh": "诶？“没问题”是什么意思啊，静香姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0323392629f3d81d7219ad5414ff7cee292b43e6773d0de21174fe05468b4e3", "ja": "この歌、男の子が女の子に、\n片想いしてるっぽい内容でしょ？", "zh": "这首歌的内容，好像是男孩子在单恋女孩子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "21513a9b4fc5dd0ec5f16b61bff8f2d4f984d33fad9e5ba2fe519ce00381d528", "ja": "すごく、気持ちがこもってるなって。\n私は、そう解釈したんだけど……。", "zh": "感觉饱含着非常真挚的感情。\n我是这么理解的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7bb3ebb81e2c88f0c22fbf60fdf4fafaaeb7ed2ec45f10f5ff4c00f8cc651348", "ja": "うん……私も、そう思ったかも。\nとっても優しい、恋心、って感じがするなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯……我也这么觉得呢。\n感觉有一种非常温柔的……恋慕之心呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "09176178fcec684202d0536ce3862f1677c9ca0baf396dbeefabc9e928d05551", "ja": "それって、男の子の気持ちと、優しい恋心……\nどっちもわからないとダメってコト？　難しいネ。", "zh": "也就是说，男孩子的心情和温柔的恋心……\n两种都得理解才行？好难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "632ef0c7df79d1f90022b2986c583270c40c0fa8fc72b16e1f72d302f5a280c1", "ja": "むむむ……そりゃあ、亜美にかかれば\n恋心のひとつやふたつ、みっつやよっつ……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……这种事要是交给亚美，\n恋爱的心情什么的，一个两个、三个四个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "1a402bbcafdaf9feed95b2722b613e369654d362ff75135bd66955ca9713976f", "ja": "兄ちゃん！　教えて？", "zh": "哥哥！教教我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e340e396a0535a93c67e7d8b85e4734b977c802f12e1831be2a6a0e208209f24", "ja": "えっ？　こっちに来るのか……。", "zh": "诶？要往这边来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "412ed649e5bbda3a005f8892b9f5947751b7a2b1accaaa358c2bd97eabf8b34a", "ja": "だって兄ちゃんは亜美の兄ちゃんだもん！\nプロデューサーでしょ、ヤクメでしょ～！", "zh": "因为哥哥就是亜美的哥哥嘛！你是制作人，也有你的职责吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e4b933526fba6a7ef5e71bdbe95d7c08e74a67a77fed0d35d5bd780a7570547f", "ja": "（こんな時だけ真っ当な事を……！）", "zh": "（偏偏只有这种时候才说正经话……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "37fa2af27a95674da094ad1b70d0896c6da5cbb9c184a7edef5b550c17a431e3", "ja": "兄ちゃんも、恋とかしたコトあるっしょ！？\n片想い？　両想い？　どんな子だった？", "zh": "哥哥也谈过恋爱吧！？\n单相思？两情相悦？对方是什么样的女孩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1037_p", "source_sha256": "eab865d8128d7c62ec3c987b2fb481ece453e60699248ce28ec5a2b0a28b2c22", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……まあ、色々とな。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……算是有过各种各样的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "4170eda62cc7d4e03d7f4b057e5397e3f37755f49068730e396f3f57967482c3", "ja": "ほうほう、色々と？", "zh": "哦哦，很多方面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ab51e197420af4b7cf21af40839125e002e12ef3296ccec21c367de24b241f7", "ja": "（色々と、なに……！？）", "zh": "（各种各样的……是什么啊……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "3b7e4b778d7d9061e242b64b3a5a4a8c2c74ba923b6c5f9c74205ffdfa83b904", "ja": "（色々と、ナニ……！？）", "zh": "（各种各样的，什、什么……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "2ab51e197420af4b7cf21af40839125e002e12ef3296ccec21c367de24b241f7", "ja": "（色々と、なに……！？）", "zh": "（各种各样的……是什么啊……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ab51e197420af4b7cf21af40839125e002e12ef3296ccec21c367de24b241f7", "ja": "（色々と、なに……！？）", "zh": "（各种各样的……是什么啊……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1043_p", "source_sha256": "c378c49c047e78650ec862815085aee4e91c24dde09f11c1295b24df03647f77", "ja": "……まあ、参考にならないと思うから、やめとくよ。\n亜美が悩んで、答えを出すのが大事だと思うし。", "zh": "……不过，我觉得也帮不上什么参考，就算了吧。\n我觉得，还是让亚美自己烦恼后得出答案比较重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "a2d69618307b4f4a432c11ab5eea8a0f543f9bcaff1f906af4a417c0cfc42796", "ja": "あーっ、はぐらかした～！　兄ちゃんのイケズ～！\n兄ちゃんはイケズです！", "zh": "啊——，你敷衍我～！哥哥真小气～！\n哥哥太小气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1045_011ami", "source_sha256": "da8d2ddf70f724a062d7b8bd54acc5ffa5135ebc8594face5ff272371f379b86", "ja": "こうなったら、みんなに聞くしか……！　てことで、\n静香お姉ちゃん、えれなん、恋バナカモーン★", "zh": "事到如今，只能问问大家了……！所以说，静香姐姐、艾蕾娜，来聊聊恋爱话题吧★", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "658abd5c7c388c3530560b886a2d3b74cba11ffd92eb76049546019762c84e7d", "ja": "えっ、いきなり……っていうか、無理に\n決まってるじゃない。私たちアイドルなんだから。", "zh": "诶，突然来这个……不对，肯定不行啊。我们可是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "309909c5088d7205806ec17e26f589fa94012219adfc234c96b46f3eb9f9f13c", "ja": "う～ん。アミの力になりたいけど、ワタシも、\nみんなに話せるようなコトはないかナ……。", "zh": "嗯～。虽然想帮亚美，但我也没有什么能告诉大家的事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1048_011ami", "source_sha256": "66977012fc9ab3b734f6e09840865e63a49fbd730885bb04ca4058e41076967d", "ja": "んじゃ、いおりんとゆきぴょんは？", "zh": "那伊织酱和雪步步呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "8813549189fefa9486d9e5f1ed359d728d080a4c61f894b6e29a7e19c345fb44", "ja": "決まってるじゃない。伊織ちゃんはみんなの\nアイドルなのよ？　誰かひとりのものにはならないの。", "zh": "当然了。伊织可是大家的偶像哦？不会只属于某一个人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1050_004yuk", "source_sha256": "86605a91d6860ae115719ec775472cdfe12740a0671ac3ae95868f05198dccf7", "ja": "わ、私は男の人に、少し慣れてきたくらいだから……\nそんな余裕は、とてもじゃないけど……。", "zh": "我、我也只是稍微习惯了和男生相处而已……\n那种从容，我真的是……完全谈不上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1051_011ami", "source_sha256": "b37d74a23630ab7fb1c5f8cd3d084e3961503cfc37512da7aca7ddc188b63b65", "ja": "はぁ……みんな、お色気が足りませんなぁ。", "zh": "唉……大家的性感魅力还不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1052_007ior", "source_sha256": "e5de6fd5c7cd8c69f340eabd1de35d0c20415c12a544b4369bcc9eed113a9898", "ja": "亜美に言われたくないわよ！", "zh": "才不想被亚美这么说呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1053_011ami", "source_sha256": "73f8a82b281563f7e2e670bfc3c7b3724a615f16c10211d9a395a9562726f7f8", "ja": "ま、いっか。なんとかなるっしょ！\n亜美も、もう中学生だかんね♪", "zh": "嘛，算了。总会有办法的啦！\n亜美也已经是初中生了嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1054_011ami", "source_sha256": "3d782fe77591670096d1ee198627df59bf048b397abea9994dce9fb2adf98526", "ja": "絶対、この曲でみんなをキュン！ってさせる！\nラブソング女王の座は、亜美がもらったー！", "zh": "绝对要用这首歌让大家怦然心动！\n爱歌女王的宝座，就由亜美拿下啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_136_1055_p", "source_sha256": "11edb0bbae88ab4512b7a85652f2d1075a3f83feb177a04012d9376a72915a31", "ja": "（なんだか、ものすごいやる気だ。\n空回りしなきゃいいけど……とりあえず見守ろう）", "zh": "（感觉她干劲十足。希望别白费力气……总之先在旁边看着吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
